>> title: Coconut Rice
>> category: Rice, Beans & Grains
>> tags: rice, coconut, side, stovetop
>> counters: Thai Kitchen
>> pairs-with: thai-green-curry, beef-rendang
>> servings: 4
>> time: 35 min
>> step.1: rinse
>> step.2: bring to a boil
>> step.3: simmer 18 min, rest 10 min
>> step.4: fluff, fold in

Rinse @jasmine rice{1 1/2%cups}(300 g) in cold water until it runs clear, then drain well.

Bring @&(~1)rice{} to a boil in a #saucepan{} with @coconut milk{13 1/2%oz}(400 mL; one can, stirred), @water{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @sugar{1%tsp}, @kosher salt{1%tsp}, and @pandan leaf{1}(knotted; or a wide strip of lime zest).

Simmer @&(~1)pot{} covered over the lowest heat for ~{18%min}, then rest off the heat for ~{10%min}.

Fluff @&(~1)rice{} with a #fork{} and fold in @toasted coconut flakes{2%Tbs}.
